    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming visual novel <i>Yomegami: My Sweet Goddess~</i> , developed by renowned Japanese studio <strong>ALcot</strong> and published by JAST, has officially launched on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a  love story about the daily life of a demon reincarnation and goddesses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/a0a918d391f34e1ff91e768f06d03f30.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: ALcot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: JAST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists: Shira Ichigo / Suimya / Hisama Kumako / Mikeou / Aona Masao (SD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Writers: Soranoshita Hajime / Morry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG: Harunose Fumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: AngelNote</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/58f1dc8326864c9614a8ebbc130bca76.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human realm is peaceful today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are unaware of the existence of miracles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are even more oblivious to the war among the gods in the divine realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the year 20XX in autumn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hibiki Narukawa, the reincarnation of the demon who once caused havoc in the divine realm, arrives in the city of Masaireshin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hibiki's mother, the goddess of rebirth, Alice, tells her son:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Accumulate good deeds in the human realm to atone for the sins of your past life. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By doing so, you can return to the divine realm.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following his mother's teachings, Hibiki grows up to be a young man of upright character, seriousness, and diligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the curse of the demon brings hardships to Hibiki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he plans to start a peaceful life in the new town,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a twist of fate, he accidentally kisses the mob boss's daughter, Kanna Uka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This misunderstanding could jeopardize his accumulated good deeds! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gears of fate set in motion by a kiss, the ties from his past life plague Hibiki with worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goddess-like mother, a love-struck mob boss's daughter, a clumsy class president, and a naive dog-eared girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between these girls, a daily, bustling, and somewhat melancholic &quot;love myth&quot; unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And thus begins this tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/a896cdaf9058126f5aa76a2e8c99a3f3.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narukawa Hayato</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hayato is the reincarnation of a powerful devil and a son of Goddess Iris, thus he is able to wield both Divine and Demonic magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7d78471f08f049386ceeac46f400a3bf.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/f9c9749f0b5f1a6a748800f71d80a375.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4ccb21b39c520a1a8f9fdda99f2016b7.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/10be484b9c2e065cfa03befa94cb6a50.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/5cd7fa401e9d4e043cd76c488a37b5ec.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7f608c21404133d9253d3d4a3a791647.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4a0ad4897afd530f1c85f32683d71840.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters except the male protagonist are voiced. The volume of each of the four female leads can be adjusted individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key bindings are supported, allowing players to customize shortcut operations according to their personal preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four endings. Depending on your choices, the subsequent plot may lead to different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a character's route has been completed, it can be accessed directly from the route selection screen on the game's start page.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming visual novel <i>Yomegami: My Sweet Goddess~</i> , developed by renowned Japanese studio <strong>ALcot</strong> and published by JAST, has officially launched on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a  love story about the daily life of a demon reincarnation and goddesses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/a0a918d391f34e1ff91e768f06d03f30.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: ALcot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: JAST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists: Shira Ichigo / Suimya / Hisama Kumako / Mikeou / Aona Masao (SD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Writers: Soranoshita Hajime / Morry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG: Harunose Fumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: AngelNote</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/58f1dc8326864c9614a8ebbc130bca76.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human realm is peaceful today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are unaware of the existence of miracles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are even more oblivious to the war among the gods in the divine realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the year 20XX in autumn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hibiki Narukawa, the reincarnation of the demon who once caused havoc in the divine realm, arrives in the city of Masaireshin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hibiki's mother, the goddess of rebirth, Alice, tells her son:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Accumulate good deeds in the human realm to atone for the sins of your past life. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By doing so, you can return to the divine realm.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following his mother's teachings, Hibiki grows up to be a young man of upright character, seriousness, and diligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the curse of the demon brings hardships to Hibiki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he plans to start a peaceful life in the new town,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a twist of fate, he accidentally kisses the mob boss's daughter, Kanna Uka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This misunderstanding could jeopardize his accumulated good deeds! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gears of fate set in motion by a kiss, the ties from his past life plague Hibiki with worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goddess-like mother, a love-struck mob boss's daughter, a clumsy class president, and a naive dog-eared girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between these girls, a daily, bustling, and somewhat melancholic &quot;love myth&quot; unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And thus begins this tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/a896cdaf9058126f5aa76a2e8c99a3f3.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narukawa Hayato</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hayato is the reincarnation of a powerful devil and a son of Goddess Iris, thus he is able to wield both Divine and Demonic magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7d78471f08f049386ceeac46f400a3bf.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/f9c9749f0b5f1a6a748800f71d80a375.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4ccb21b39c520a1a8f9fdda99f2016b7.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/10be484b9c2e065cfa03befa94cb6a50.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/5cd7fa401e9d4e043cd76c488a37b5ec.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7f608c21404133d9253d3d4a3a791647.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4a0ad4897afd530f1c85f32683d71840.avif?t=1755592832\" width=800 height=133 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters except the male protagonist are voiced. The volume of each of the four female leads can be adjusted individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key bindings are supported, allowing players to customize shortcut operations according to their personal preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four endings. Depending on your choices, the subsequent plot may lead to different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a character's route has been completed, it can be accessed directly from the route selection screen on the game's start page.</p></li></ul>",
